    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/c83fa0fee28634cf7d822f366b1202e7.avif?t=1749373221\" data-has-big width=800 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u201cWould you follow the voice of a doll... into a cursed castle that doesn\u2019t want you to leave?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whispers began the moment you opened the door. You awaken inside <strong>Kurogane Castle</strong>, a place sealed in darkness and silence for over 300 years. A ghostly doll calls you by name how does it know who you are? Why are the spirits drawn to <i>you</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle hides forgotten rituals, haunted puzzles, and a past soaked in betrayal and blood. Each room is a mystery. Each door is a test. And something ancient watches your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn't just a game. It's a question: \ud83d\udc49 <strong>Can you break the curse... or will you become part of the legend?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/e551f49779e22b9619fd7ec7b5b90d9a.poster.avif?t=1749373221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/e551f49779e22b9619fd7ec7b5b90d9a.webm?t=1749373221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/e551f49779e22b9619fd7ec7b5b90d9a.mp4?t=1749373221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY &amp; PUZZLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Whispers of Kurogane Castle</i>, you\u2019re not just solving puzzles. You\u2019re <strong>unraveling a ghost story</strong> buried beneath centuries of silence.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a mysterious doll that seems to know your past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore haunted chambers inspired by real Japanese folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle you solve reveals a new piece of the curse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: fail too many times, and the spirits grow stronger\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What really happened in Kurogane Castle? Why are the spirits so angry? The answers lie beyond puzzles only <strong>the brave and the curious</strong> can solve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/0ec3be4853360030c6e46adcfaa3216a.avif?t=1749373221\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span>KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Mind-bending puzzles</strong> that blend logic, memory, symbols, and spirit energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf8e <strong>Doll-guided exploration</strong> \u2014 she speaks to you\u2026 but can she be trusted?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfef <strong>Authentic Japanese environments</strong>, inspired by Edo-period history and legend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude31 <strong>Atmospheric horror</strong>, tension, whispers, and surprises around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Rich narrative</strong> that rewards players who read, observe, and dig deep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Playable in 10 languages</strong> with full localization.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Failure has consequences</strong> \u2014 the spirits remember everything.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326950/extras/7a9251598fb205b485f6662c53d49547.avif?t=1749373221\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to know the truth behind the whispers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong> so you\u2019re the first to step into Kurogane Castle and uncover the secrets the spirits died protecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The doll is waiting.<br>And she knows\u2026 you\u2019re coming.<strong> </strong><br>  <br>  </p>",
